\\ UNIT 02: COMPARISON AND LOGICAL OPERATORS

5 == 5      \\ Equality
5 != 3      \\ Inequality
5 < 8       \\ Less than
5 > 8       \\ Greater than
5 <= 5      \\ Less than or equal
5 >= 6      \\ Greater than or equal

(2 < 3) && (4 > 1)  \\ Logical AND
(2 < 3) || (4 < 1)  \\ Logical OR
!(2 < 3)            \\ Logical NOT

x = 10;     \\ Assignment
x == 10     \\ Compare equality
